    "self-hosting.costs.lede1": "MIAO source is licensed under Apache License 2.0 and the software itself is free; ",
    "self-hosting.costs.lede2": "but in a self-hosted deployment the server, domain, backups, model inference and mail service are prepared and paid for by the operator. ",
